  "summary": "Patch round on PR #15514 for contract-review conditions 1 and 2 only; nothing else in the PR changed. Both edits are prose or comment: no schema, assertion, registration, declaration, turbo.json or generated artifact moved, and the pin suite's 425/425 is unchanged. Condition 5's re-merge trigger FIRED - packages/spec had moved on origin/main since 5023630b1 (one commit, 615fac3a0, touching packages/spec/src/api/protocol.test.ts) - so a full os-regen-merge.sh lap plus rebuild and check:generated ran and are in this push. Two commits: 3273a3420 (the two edits) and 3c7b84d4c (the merge). Final head 3c7b84d4c, tree clean, every measurement below taken on it. PR left as a draft, needs:contract-review untouched on both carriers, body unedited (footer intact), auto_merge null, nothing enqueued. Conditions 3 and 4 are the seat's RECORD actions and were not touched; the PR body still says 'thirteen distinct key names', which condition 3 assigns to a seat comment rather than a body edit. The wrong count survives nowhere else in the 31-file tree (the one other 'thirteen' in registry.ts is an unrelated pre-existing entry about filter preset names).",
