      "packages/spec/json-schema/ - not in the diff because it is gitignored (.gitignore:61 'packages/spec/json-schema/', confirmed by git check-ignore -v exit 0); it is build output, re-emitted on build. Kept in the changeset bullet for that reason, labelled gitignored.",
