    "The remaining derived families (dispatch-gates derives the whole PR's ~89-family set; the implementing dev ran it on the pre-patch head with 84 exit 0 and 5 NOT MEASURED). DECLARED NARROWING: my delta is two files already inside that set, one a changeset and one a comment, so I ran the subset that actually reads those two files plus everything condition 5 names. CI runs the farm regardless.",
    "Repo-wide pnpm lint - CI-owned, as on the implementation round. I do NOT claim the three-part proven-narrowing evidence for it; it is simply not run.",
