    "Condition 1(a) wording is not a verbatim splice of the verdict's replacement string. The verdict gave the target facts and the dispatch asked for product prose rather than a correction note, so I wrote flowing prose carrying exactly the three required facts (fourteen sites, twelve distinct names, and the two names that occur twice). Declaring it so the seat can compare against the verdict text.",
    "Condition 1(b) became three bullets instead of one. The verdict required removing three items from the kit list and adding two positive statements; that did not fit one bullet without burying it. No other changeset content moved.",
